  "review_text": "ugh.&nbsp; I know it's a re-introduction issue, but virtually nothing happened except exactly what they said - some characters were reintroduced, but there was almost no meat on that bone!&nbsp; Apparently there's more to learn about Victoria Bentley though...\n\n[BOTTOM_LINE]\n<b>FIXME - write something</b><b></b>",
